Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.94,0:00:07.90,sign_5011_20_The_Kingdom_of_B,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,305)}Year 998 of the Holy Era, Autumn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:07.36,italicstop,Rio,0,0,0,,It's been two weeks since \NI arrived in the Yagumo region.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:11.41,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,I haven't found any clues about \Nmy mother and father yet, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:14.16,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,Everyone here has black hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:18.39,main,villagers,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:23.30,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:26.87,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I am a traveler, and I'm looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.31,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I would very much like to meet \Nwith the head of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.44,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Do you know who that might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:33.30,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Oh, um, h-hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:37.30,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,You're a traveler? My grandma \Nis the head of the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:41.27,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Really? If it isn't any trouble, \Nwould you show me the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:42.31,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Oh! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.83,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Sayo, what are you doing? \NYou're gonna get left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:48.31,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Wait, Miss Ruri!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.04,0:01:09.13,sign_3238_18_Seirei_Gensouki,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,125)\blur4\fad(897,1)}Seirei Gensouki
